B.HL=new A.h("fever-in-infant-under-3-months","Cefotaxime","Infant fever (<3 months): urgent hospital assessment; cefotaxime dosing must match day of life. Older-child meningitis figures are not this infant pathway.","injection","Egyptian National Drug Formulary - Antimicrobial 2023 (cefotaxime monograph, p246)","Empirical antibiotic","Not applicable - the patient is an infant under 3 months (see the paediatric dose)","Until cultures are back",u.OY)
B.avy=new A.h("gangrene-emergency-referral","Piperacillin + Tazobactam","Pediatric surgical emergency; receiving team calculates piperacillin-component dose. Do not use combined-product adult amount.","injection",u.In,u.p,u.IM,u.mb,u.YR)
