B.ay2=new A.h("pancreatic-cancer","Morphine","Specialist/palliative care; formulation-specific child morphine dosing. Do not divide sustained-release tablets; young children require suitable oral solution.","oral.solid",u.mZ,u.mJ,u.iT,u.p3,u.dI)
B.ay3=new A.h("paraphimosis","Lidocaine","During supervised reduction: lidocaine <2%; total <5 mg/kg and <300 mg/dose; no repeat within 2 h. Mild cases may need no anesthetic.","injection",u.gy,"Local anaesthetic for the reduction",u.va,u.fV,u.fh)
B.ax3=new A.h("pelvic-inflammatory-disease","Paracetamol","PID guideline age \u226516; younger patients need a different pathway. Paracetamol is adjunct symptom relief only.","oral.solid",u.m,"If pelvic pain or fever needs adjunct symptom relief alongside the selected PID regimen","1000 mg three or four times daily, maximum 4000 mg in 24 hours","while the pelvic pain lasts, reviewed at the 72-hour follow-up",u.DL)
