B.aD6=new A.h("seizure-first-aid","Phenytoin","After benzodiazepines, monitored hospital IV loading: 15\u201320 mg/kg; rate 1\u20133 mg/kg/min or 50 mg/min, whichever slower. Continuous ECG/BP/respiratory monitoring; caution below 1 year.","injection","Egyptian National Drug Formulary - Nervous System 2025 (phenytoin monograph)","If status epilepticus requires monitored second-line escalation after benzodiazepine treatment","Status epilepticus: intravenous loading dose 10-15 mg/kg given slowly at a rate not exceeding 50 mg/minute (50 mg over 2-3 minutes in an elderly patient with heart disease); then maintenance 100 mg intravenously or orally every 6-8 hours","Single loading dose, then maintenance until the patient is stabilised and transferred",u.Cb)
B.auJ=new A.h("septic-arthritis-referral",u.B,"Hot/swollen joint or limp with fever: same-day pediatric referral. Await aspiration before antibiotics unless sepsis; sepsis treatment takes priority.",null,"No dose - emergency referral pathway, no medicine given in primary care",null,"Same-day referral to a hospital specialist who can aspirate the joint. Do NOT start an antibiotic in the clinic first.","Immediate same-day referral",u.Ai)
