B.aui=new A.h("strangulated-hernia","Paracetamol","IV analgesia during urgent transfer: \u226410 kg 7.5 mg/kg/dose (max 30 mg/kg/day); >10\u201333 kg 15 mg/kg/dose (max 60 mg/kg/day, 2 g/day); 33\u201350 kg 15 mg/kg/dose (max 3 g/day). \u22654 h apart; CrCl \u226430: \u22656 h. Do not delay transfer.","injection","Paracetamol 10 mg/ml solution for infusion SmPC section 4.2 (eMC product 15148)","If IV analgesia is given during immediate surgical transfer: give paracetamol without delaying transfer","1 g by intravenous infusion over 15 minutes for pain during transfer. Minimum 4 hours between doses, maximum 4 g in 24 hours (3 g if under 50 kg, malnourished, or with hepatic risk factors).","Single dose during transfer",u.QO)
