B.aBR=new A.h("recurrent-acute-otitis-media","Paracetamol","\u22651 month: 15 mg/kg/dose 3\u20134/day (max 60 mg/kg/day); <1 month: 10 mg/kg/dose 3\u20134/day (max 40 mg/kg/day). Severe acute malnutrition: 10 mg/kg/dose \u22643/day. Max 500 mg/dose.","oral.solid","MSF Essential Drugs 2024 - paracetamol (oral): adult 1 g 3 or 4 times daily, maximum 4 g daily; child 1 month and over 15 mg/kg 3 or 4 times daily, maximum 60 mg/kg daily; child under 1 month 10 mg/kg 3 or 4 times daily, maximum 40 mg/kg daily. The 500 mg per-dose ceiling is MSF's own top paediatric band, one 500 mg tablet three times daily from 30 to under 50 kg.","Pain and fever",u.U,"Through the painful days of each episode, including at bedtime",u.EF)
